# Generated by "tox -e genprotos" (protos/_make_stubs.sh); never edit by hand.
# linguist-generated collapses these in GitHub's diff view, and the
# issue-fix workflow leaves them out of its size cap: adding one field to a
# message rewrites every serialized offset in the regenerated _pb2.py.
#
# That makes linguist-generated an exemption from the cap as well as a
# display hint, so mark only files a generator writes. Other generated
# files which should stay visible in a diff -- the database load budget,
# say -- do not belong here; if the two lists ever need to differ, give the
# cap an attribute of its own rather than widening this one.
# shakenfist/tests/test_issue_fix_workflow_seams.py checks that every
# generated stub is covered.
shakenfist/protos/*_pb2.py linguist-generated
shakenfist/protos/*_pb2.pyi linguist-generated
shakenfist/protos/*_pb2_grpc.py linguist-generated
shakenfist/protos/*_pb2_grpc.pyi linguist-generated
protos/shakenfist_enums.proto linguist-generated
